      "message": "[error] Line 66: 🔴 `LIBCLIENT_DBUS_SOURCES` is only populated under `if(NOT ENABLE_LIBWRAP)` in the top-level CMakeLists.txt. With the default `ENABLE_LIBWRAP\u003dON` and `BUILD_TESTING\u003dON`, this expands to `set_source_files_properties(PROPERTIES GENERATED TRUE)`, which can make CMake treat `PROPERTIES` as a source and fail during configuration. Guard this call with the same `if(NOT ENABLE_LIBWRAP)` condition (or otherwise ensure the list is non-empty) so libwrap test builds remain configurable.",
